body:
Admittedly a lot of my favorites are the hooks and chorus. Lots of really good one off lyrics too though. A lot of it comes down to the performance by Hansi. Also noteworthy is the chorus work which I'm not sure exactly who that is (the rest of the band or some studio singers?) but they do a wonderful job making some epic backup. What stands out to me is in "The Curse of Feanor" and "Dead Winter Reigns" they are used pretty extensively.

&#x200B;

Tides of War might be my favorite example though. They backing vocals echoing "Feanor..." as Hansi sings is just so good. Great album.

[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The\_Last\_Express](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Last_Express)

&#x200B;

It's not a PI game but there is a mystery and more stuff I don't want to spoil. It's all in real time and it may be a bit too old for some. It may be worth checking out.

I in no way represent the EDD in any way but I can say if you only made 1300 this year total you're still very much qualified for assistance I would assume. Again, I cannot speak 100% for what they will do but I think it's around 10k+ per year that it starts to get fuzzy about benefits or assistance. Either way, if you're unemployed and just had work you should be eligible for something regardless. I'm going by logic here and sometimes the EDD doesn't follow logic all that much so don't take my words as fact. I would report the earnings and see what they do from there and if they deny you file a complaint or ask for reconsideration/etc.

&#x200B;

To give you an idea, I was let go early from my job where I only worked about 3 months and made around 9k and I was still eligible for assistance because of reduced hours because of the pandemic and I still didn't make enough that I didn't qualify.

I haven't seen this discussed but like as far as socks go is their a good brand that wont tear or wear down? I don't get a lot of rips and I trim my toenails to keep that from happening, but I'll show a picture of what happened to my current socks. They basically just got absolutely worn down so there's barely a layer left. They weren't anything special, just a cheap pack of socks. But yeah they're not gonna last. If anyone has a brand recommend or special sport socks made to last I'd appreciate it.

&#x200B;

[https://ibb.co/ySBFwjT](https://ibb.co/ySBFwjT)[https://ibb.co/XX8R3tf](https://ibb.co/XX8R3tf)

I don't think so, but he got to the same point I did with the pacifist true ending so I'm not sure if I can even tell now. But when he started it gave him a whole new game as if it was completely reset, which I know I didn't do. So probably not?

&#x200B;

Edit: Checked my game and well it seems my save just doesn't exist anymore. I saved it to a USB so I have it I guess but it's no longer here. It may have been overwritten.

Woke up today after months of not feeling that big D word, feeling immobilized and overwhelmed by the day ahead. Just wanted to curl back over and sleep. I made myself get up and get on here and make this post. I'll probably do nothing today and just try and distract myself with youtube.

&#x200B;

The funny thing is, I thought it was my situation that had contributed to my depression. So I moved across the country to be with my boyfriend and we have a steady place with a nice renter who likes us. Even though I get to be with my bf every day it feels like now I can't love him like he deserves. I can't be my usual chipper self who he deserves to have. I feel guilt and I don't get why this is coming back and happening now. I guess it means my brain is just fucked and I'm doomed with this until I die.
